Perfect! The route is valid. The retrosynthesis involves a Diels-Alder disconnection where the target bicyclic molecule is synthesized from:
1. Butadiene (C=CC=C) - the diene
2. Methyl 3-oxocyclobut-1-enecarboxylate (COC(=O)C1=CC(=O)C1) - the dienophile

Both precursors are commercially available, making this a practical one-step synthesis.

